### Gross Margin Calculation
Question: "台積電毛利率趨勢"
Output:
{
  "sub_queries": [
    {"id": "q0", "operation": "finmind_query", "datasets": ["TaiwanStockFinancialStatements"], "params": {"stock_id": "2330", "start_date": "2022-01-01"}, "depends_on": []},
    {"id": "q1", "operation": "compute", "computed_field": "gross_margin", "formula": "q0.gross_profit / q0.revenue * 100", "depends_on": ["q0"]}
  ]
}